<!-- Quick key -->
<section class="container-prose pb-10">
  <div class="rounded-lg p-5" style="border: 1px solid rgb(var(--line))">
    <div class="eyebrow mb-3">How to read a row</div>
    <dl class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-3 m-0 text-sm">
      <div>
        <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider" style="color: rgb(var(--accent))">The spectrum band</dt>
        <dd class="m-0 mt-1 leading-snug" style="color: rgb(var(--fg) / 0.85)">A filled flame tick is an early, lead-time-rich stage; a hollow tick is a later stage; a hollow ring on an empty span is a station with nothing on it yet.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider" style="color: rgb(var(--accent))">Signal class</dt>
        <dd class="m-0 mt-1 leading-snug" style="color: rgb(var(--fg) / 0.85)">The tier chip: Live Signal moves fast and decays fast; analysis sources stay relevant longer. The ranker weights each accordingly.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider" style="color: rgb(var(--accent-2))">heating</dt>
        <dd class="m-0 mt-1 leading-snug" style="color: rgb(var(--fg) / 0.85)">The same story in two or more independent source families — not two feeds of one site.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider" style="color: rgb(var(--muted))">seen in / via</dt>
        <dd class="m-0 mt-1 leading-snug" style="color: rgb(var(--fg) / 0.85)">How many families carried it, or the single source that did.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

